{"global_index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_270", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The creeper in Minecraft was the result of a bug while implementing which creature?\n\nOptions: \nA. Chicken\nB. Zombie\nC. Cow\nD. Pig\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{B}. The creeper in Minecraft was created when the developer, Markus \"Notch\" Persson, was trying to code the features for a pig but accidentally combined the height and width, resulting in the unique character we know today as the creeper. Thus, the origin of the creeper is linked to a bug during the implementation of the zombie.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 97, "output_tokens": 78, "total_tokens": 175}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{B}. The creeper in Minecraft was created when the developer, Markus \"Notch\" Persson, was trying to code the features for a pig but accidentally combined the height and width, resulting in the unique character we know today as the creeper. Thus, the origin of the creeper is linked to a bug during the implementation of the zombie.", "ground_truth": "3", "score": 0.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 6.135e-05}}
