{"global_index": "OpenTDB_Geography_792", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of these countries is \"doubly landlocked\" (surrounded entirely by one or more landlocked countries)?\n\nOptions: \nA. Uzbekistan\nB. Switzerland\nC. Bolivia\nD. Ethiopia\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{A}. Uzbekistan is the only country among the options listed that is doubly landlocked, as it is surrounded by other landlocked countries such as Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan, and Afghanistan. The other countries listed (Switzerland, Bolivia, and Ethiopia) are not doubly landlocked, as they have at least one neighboring country that has coastal access.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 105, "output_tokens": 82, "total_tokens": 187}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{A}. Uzbekistan is the only country among the options listed that is doubly landlocked, as it is surrounded by other landlocked countries such as Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan, and Afghanistan. The other countries listed (Switzerland, Bolivia, and Ethiopia) are not doubly landlocked, as they have at least one neighboring country that has coastal access.", "ground_truth": "0", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 6.494999999999999e-05}}
{"global_index": "OpenTDB_Geography_2099", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following language families is the most controversial amongst modern linguists?\n\nOptions: \nA. Indo-European\nB. Dravidian\nC. Altaic\nD. Sino-Tibetan\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The most controversial language family among modern linguists is C. Altaic. This is due to debates regarding its validity as a genetic grouping, as some scholars argue that the similarities between the languages in this family are due to areal features rather than common ancestry. In contrast, Indo-European, Dravidian, and Sino-Tibetan have more widely accepted classifications. \n\nThus, the answer is \\boxed{C}.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 103, "output_tokens": 84, "total_tokens": 187}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The most controversial language family among modern linguists is C. Altaic. This is due to debates regarding its validity as a genetic grouping, as some scholars argue that the similarities between the languages in this family are due to areal features rather than common ancestry. In contrast, Indo-European, Dravidian, and Sino-Tibetan have more widely accepted classifications. \n\nThus, the answer is \\boxed{C}.", "ground_truth": "2", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 6.585e-05}}
