{"global_index": "ArcMMLU_2", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In transport layer, the send side breaks application messages into ( ) passes to network layer.\n\nOptions: \nA. Frames\nB. Segments\nC. Data-grams\nD. bit streams\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{B}. In the transport layer, particularly in the context of the TCP protocol, application messages are typically divided into segments before being passed to the network layer. This segmentation allows for more efficient and reliable data transmission.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 103, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 152}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{B}. In the transport layer, particularly in the context of the TCP protocol, application messages are typically divided into segments before being passed to the network layer. This segmentation allows for more efficient and reliable data transmission.", "ground_truth": "B", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 4.484999999999999e-05}}
