{"global_index": "MMLUPro_computer science_9084", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which among them has the strongest wireless security?\n\nOptions: \nA. WPA\nB. WPA2-Enterprise\nC. WEP\nD. WEP+\nE. WPA-PSK\nF. WEP2\nG. WPA2\nH. WPA3\nI. WPA4\nJ. WPA2-PSK\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{H}. WPA3 is the latest standard in wireless security, providing enhanced protection against brute-force attacks and improved security for public networks compared to previous standards. WPA2 is also secure but does not offer the same level of security features as WPA3.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 131, "output_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 187}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{H}. WPA3 is the latest standard in wireless security, providing enhanced protection against brute-force attacks and improved security for public networks compared to previous standards. WPA2 is also secure but does not offer the same level of security features as WPA3.", "ground_truth": "7", "score": 1.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 5.324999999999999e-05}}
