{"global_index": "OpenTDB_General Knowledge_358", "question": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Albert Einstein had trouble with mathematics when he was in school.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "llm_selected": "gpt-4o-mini", "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A} \n\nAlbert Einstein did indeed struggle with certain aspects of mathematics during his early school years, which is often surprising given his later achievements. However, he eventually excelled in the subject and became one of the greatest physicists of all time. His early difficulties do illustrate that struggles in one area don't preclude future success.", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 85, "output_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 153}, "success": true, "provider": "openai", "error": null, "evaluation_result": {"extracted_answer": "\\boxed{A} \n\nAlbert Einstein did indeed struggle with certain aspects of mathematics during his early school years, which is often surprising given his later achievements. However, he eventually excelled in the subject and became one of the greatest physicists of all time. His early difficulties do illustrate that struggles in one area don't preclude future success.", "ground_truth": "1", "score": 0.0, "metric": "mcq_accuracy", "inference_cost": 5.3549999999999994e-05}}
